// D5344 — a record literal with an empty list field nothing ever stores into, at every
// delivery position and in both faces. The un-annotated face left the list's element unbound,
// so the record had no shape and an un-annotated `Map()` holding it had no value rep; the TEST
// reads the scalar and the list's length, so a lost or rebuilt record cannot take the HIT.
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/README.md, "Template format".
// @@PRELUDE@@
// @@VALUE@@
{ n: 1, kids: [] }
// @@TYPE@@
{ n: i32, kids: i32[] }
// @@TEST@@
v.n == 1 && v.kids.length == 0
// @@HIT@@
print(v.n)
// @@MISS@@
print("miss")
// @@WANT@@
1
